x":1480,"y":1561,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"메시지를","x":1640,"y":1563,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"보낸다.","x":1798,"y":1563,"width":106,"height":39}]},{"text":"출발지는 한 패킷을 보내고 그에 해당하는 응답 메시지를 받을 때까지 경과된 시간을","words":[{"text":"출발지는","x":567,"y":1619,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":718,"y":1620,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"패킷을","x":768,"y":1620,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"보내고","x":884,"y":1621,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"그에","x":1001,"y":1621,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"해당하는","x":1086,"y":1621,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"응답","x":1237,"y":1621,"width":71,"height":38},{"text":"메시지를","x":1323,"y":1621,"width":140,"height":37},{"text":"받을","x":1478,"y":1622,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"때까지","x":1564,"y":1623,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"경과된","x":1687,"y":1623,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"시간을","x":1807,"y":1623,"width":98,"height":40}]},{"text":"기록한다. 또한 메시지를 보내온 라우터(혹은 목적지 호스트) 이름과 주소도 기록한다.","words":[{"text":"기록한다.","x":569,"y":1680,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":726,"y":1680,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"메시지를","x":807,"y":1681,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"보내온","x":956,"y":1682,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"라우터(혹은","x":1074,"y":1682,"width":185,"height":40},{"text":"목적지","x":1271,"y":1683,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"호스트)","x":1389,"y":1685,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"이름과","x":1523,"y":1683,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"주소도","x":1640,"y":1686,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"기록한다.","x":1763,"y":1684,"width":140,"height":38}]},{"text":"이 방식은 출발지가 자신에서부터 목적지까지 패킷이 흘러간 경로를 재구성할 수 있으","words":[{"text":"이","x":568,"y":1742,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"방식은","x":614,"y":1742,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"출발지가","x":728,"y":1741,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"자신에서부터","x":877,"y":1743,"width":201,"height":38},{"text":"목적지까지","x":1095,"y":1744,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"패킷이","x":1283,"y":1744,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"흘러간","x":1398,"y":1744,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"경로를","x":1519,"y":1744,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"재구성할","x":1638,"y":1745,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1792,"y":1745,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"있으","x":1842,"y":1745,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"며, 출발지는 모든 중간에 있는 라우터까지의 왕복 지연을 결정할 수 있다. Traceroute","words":[{"text":"며,","x":568,"y":1803,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"출발지는","x":622,"y":1803,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":773,"y":1805,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"중간에","x":854,"y":1804,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"있는","x":972,"y":1804,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"라우터까지의","x":1052,"y":1805,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"왕복","x":1272,"y":1806,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"지연을","x":1357,"y":1806,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"결정할","x":1476,"y":1805,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1593,"y":1806,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":1646,"y":1806,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"Traceroute","x":1737,"y":1811,"width":166,"height":29}]},{"text":"는 실제로 방금 설명한 과정을 세 번 반복한다. 그래서 출발지는 실제로 3 • N 패킷을","words":[{"text":"는","x":566,"y":1867,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"실제로","x":616,"y":1865,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"방금","x":732,"y":1864,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"설명한","x":815,"y":1865,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"과정을","x":930,"y":1866,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"세","x":1047,"y":1866,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"번","x":1098,"y":1866,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"반복한다.","x":1146,"y":1867,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"그래서","x":1309,"y":1867,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"출발지는","x":1428,"y":1867,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"실제로","x":1586,"y":1868,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"3","x":1707,"y":1872,"width":17,"height":29},{"text":"•","x":1742,"y":1884,"width":5,"height":5},{"text":"N","x":1761,"y":1872,"width":29,"height":28},{"text":"패킷을","x":1805,"y":1866,"width":99,"height":39}]},{"text":"목적지로 보낸다. RFC 1393은 Traceroute에 대해 상세히 기술하고 있다.","words":[{"text":"목적지로","x":566,"y":1926,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"보낸다.","x":715,"y":1926,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"RFC","x":839,"y":1931,"width":72,"height":30},{"text":"1393은","x":929,"y":1928,"width":109,"height":36},{"text":"Traceroute에","x":1049,"y":1928,"width":203,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":1269,"y":1929,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"상세히","x":1350,"y":1929,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"기술하고","x":1469,"y":1929,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1625,"y":1930,"width":75,"height":38}]},{"text":"여기에 Traceroute 프로그램의 결과 예가 있다. 그 경로는 출발지 호스트 gaia•cs.","words":[{"text":"여기에","x":634,"y":1988,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"Traceroute","x":749,"y":1993,"width":166,"height":30},{"text":"프로그램의","x":931,"y":1989,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"결과","x":1118,"y":1989,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"예가","x":1201,"y":1990,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1286,"y":1991,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1378,"y":1997,"width":34,"height":25},{"text":"경로는","x":1429,"y":1992,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"출발지","x":1546,"y":1992,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"호스트","x":1668,"y":1994,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"gaia•cs.","x":1789,"y":1995,"width":112,"height":38}]},{"text":"umass.edu/매사추세츠대학교)로부터 cis.匹ly.edu/폴리테크닉대학교)까지 추적하고","words":[{"text":"umass.edu/매사추세츠대학교)로부터","x":565,"y":2051,"width":574,"height":40},{"text":"cis.匹ly.edu/폴리테크닉대학교)까지","x":1161,"y":2053,"width":581,"height":40},{"text":"추적하고","x":1765,"y":2053,"width":137,"height":38}]},{"text":"있다. 결괴물에는 6개 항목이 있다. 첫 항목은 앞에서 기술한 n 값, 즉 경로상의 라우터","words":[{"text":"있다.","x":567,"y":2112,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"결괴물에는","x":658,"y":2113,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"6개","x":839,"y":2114,"width":51,"height":38},{"text":"항목이","x":905,"y":2114,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1022,"y":2113,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"첫","x":1111,"y":2114,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"항목은","x":1156,"y":2114,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"앞에서","x":1274,"y":2114,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"기술한","x":1392,"y":21